    "title": "Firefighter crews respond to Kapahulu gas leak - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By HNN Staff ,\n1 days ago HONOLULU (HawaiiNewsNow) - Firefighters responded to a gas leak in Kapahulu on Tuesday morning. The Honolulu Fire Department said crews were called to McCorriston Street shortly after 10 a.m. and found an active leak caused by damaged piping during street construction. Honolulu police issued a traffic advisory at 10:47 a.m.,... Read full article",
